  "title": "Pan-Roasted Marble Potatoes",
  "description": "A colorful combination of red, gold, and purple baby potatoes is pan-roasted with bacon and rosemary for a simple and delicious side or as a tasty start for potato salad.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
